/-- Gloas:1879-1916 / 1999. An exited onboarded builder with room in the
15-cap contributes its item to the first full parent. Slot Nodup stays
on `accepted_nodup`. -/
theorem first_payload_exited_builder_items {b : Block}
    (hreg : b.builders =
